    "\n",
    "### Método de Euler\n",
    "\n",
    "Para una masa unida a un resorte:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "y''(t)+\\omega^2y(t)=-g\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Definimos $u(t)=y'(t)$ para transformar la EDO de segundo orden en un sistema de primer orden:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{x}(t)=\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}y(t)\\\\u(t)\\end{pmatrix},\n",
    "\\qquad\n",
    "\\frac{d\\mathbf{x}}{dt}=\n",
    "\\begin{pmatrix}u(t)\\\\-\\omega^2y(t)-g\\end{pmatrix}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Aplicando la derivada adelantada obtenemos el método de Euler:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\mathbf{x}_{n+1}=\\mathbf{x}_n+h\\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x}_n,t_n)}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Calculamos la posición y velocidad siguientes utilizando los valores de la iteración anterior.\n"
   ]
  },
