   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## Método de Runge-Kutta de segundo orden (RK2)\n",
    "\n",
    "Consideramos el sistema de EDOs:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{d\\mathbf{x}}{dt}=\\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x},t)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Primero estimamos la solución a medio paso mediante Euler:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\mathbf{x}_{n+1/2}=\\mathbf{x}_n+\\frac{h}{2}\\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x}_n,t_n)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Luego calculamos la solución en el siguiente instante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{\\mathbf{x}_{n+1}=\\mathbf{x}_n+h\\mathbf{f}(\\mathbf{x}_{n+1/2},t_n+h/2)}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "El método tiene un error de truncamiento local de orden $O(h^3)$.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 39,
   "id": "cd8c430e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x_RK2 = np.zeros((Ntiempo, 2))\n",
    "x_RK2[0] = x[0]  # Condiciones iniciales [y0, u0]\n",
    "\n",
    "for n in range(Ntiempo-1):\n",
    "    xmedio = x_RK2[n] + (h/2)*f(x_RK2[n], omega, g)\n",
    "    x_RK2[n+1] = x_RK2[n] + h*f(xmedio, omega, g)\n",
    "\n",
    "y_RK2 = x_RK2[:, 0]\n",
    "u_RK2 = x_RK2[:, 1]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f10fe7e2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## Método de Runge-Kutta de cuarto orden (RK4)\n",
    "\n",
    "Se calculan cuatro estimaciones de la derivada:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "K_1 &= f(x_n,t_n)\\\\\n",
    "K_2 &= f(x_n+\\frac{h}{2}K_1,t_n+\\frac{h}{2})\\\\\n",
    "K_3 &= f(x_n+\\frac{h}{2}K_2,t_n+\\frac{h}{2})\\\\\n",
    "K_4 &= f(x_n+hK_3,t_n+h)\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "La solución se actualiza mediante:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\boxed{x_{n+1}=x_n+\\frac{h}{6}(K_1+2K_2+2K_3+K_4)}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "El método tiene un error de truncamiento local de orden $O(h^5)$.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "id": "07c64a65",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "x_RK4 = np.zeros((Ntiempo, 2))\n",
    "x_RK4[0] = x[0]  # Condiciones iniciales [y0, u0]\n",
    "\n",
    "for n in range(Ntiempo-1):\n",
    "    K1 = f(x_RK4[n], omega, g)\n",
    "    K2 = f(x_RK4[n] + K1*h/2, omega, g)\n",
    "    K3 = f(x_RK4[n] + K2*h/2, omega, g)\n",
    "    K4 = f(x_RK4[n] + K3*h, omega, g)\n",
    "\n",
    "    x_RK4[n+1] = x_RK4[n] + (h/6)*(K1 + 2*K2 + 2*K3 + K4)\n",
    "\n",
    "y_RK4 = x_RK4[:, 0]\n",
    "u_RK4 = x_RK4[:, 1]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "64bb08e5",
